{{!
    @template local_coursegen/preview_bold_or_link

    One entry of a navigation row: bold text when it names where the reader
    already is, a link to get there otherwise. Shared by every previewed
    module that used to build this pattern by hand (a glossary's special/
    all/alphabet links, and alike).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * current - bool.
    * text - string.

    Context variables optional for this template:
    * url - string, required when current is false.
    * title - string.
    * suffix - string, already-rendered HTML appended after either form.
}}
{{#current}}<b>{{{text}}}</b>{{/current}}{{^current}}<a{{#title}} title="{{title}}"{{/title}} href="{{{url}}}">{{{text}}}</a>{{/current}}{{{suffix}}}
